            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"08-checkpointed-graphs-and-human-approval\">08 \u00b7 Checkpointed graphs and human approval</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Follow conditional routing, parallel verification, rollback and retry. A passing patch pauses at approval until a human submits a checksum-bound decision.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Keep the task, model and fixtures fixed. Inspect evidence before comparing scores.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Runner revision: <code>35f2438de849313d5025960e2e63fe6f66c04178</code>. Opening this notebook displays saved evidence and launches no inference or coding work.</span></span>"
          }
